# steps/table-receiver.md §8: the conversion table stands at depth in a part of the program -- in the body
# of a method of unit_s7_tbl_part_depth_part.lm2 (harness Table); a part gives the program its methods and
# its source tables, wherever they stand.  Entry 7.
fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
